{title: Duniya O Duniya}
{artist: Kishore Kumar S D Burman}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] Duniya o duniya [G] tera jawaab nahin,        [D] Duniya o duniya
[D] Teri jafao ka bas [E] koi hisab [D] nahi,        [D] Tu chhaanw hai ya hai
[D] dhup khabar kis [G] ko,        [G] Kya hai tera asa [Em] li
[A] rup khabar kis [D] ko,        [D] Aye najr kaise, tu
[E] ansu hai khwaab [D] nahin,        [D] Teri jubaan pe hai
[D] jikr sitaaron [G] ka,        [G] Tere labon pe [Em] hai
[A] naam bahaaron [D] ka,        [D] Par tere daaman men
[E] kaante hain gulaab [D] nahi,        [D] Ye kin khyaalon me
[D] kho gaye hain [G] aap,        [G] Kyo kuchh pareshaan [Em] se
[A] ho gaye hain [D] aap,        [D] Ap se to mujh ko, kuchh
[E] shikawa janaab [D] nahin
